# Mutation plan for the three slash-command routes that reach the built-in registry —
# POST /commands/execute and the two team autocomplete reads (the end of commands.rs,
# command_provider.rs, command_suggestions.rs).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/cmddispatch.plan
#
# Every line was traced to a fixture in parity/command_dispatch.rs that changes under it before
# launch. Not planned, because the stack cannot show them: the admin/user role in suggestions
# (every command here carries system_user) and the plugin-present half of the plugin gate (Go
# plugin directory is empty). The two controls are a closure rename and a swap of two route
# registrations with different paths.
